[00:05.66]I could be the twist, the one to make you stop
[00:05.66]我愿成为转折点 让你驻足停留
[00:08.92]The icing on your cake, the cherry on the top
[00:08.92]是你蛋糕上的糖霜 顶端的樱桃
[00:12.36]It's heaven in my heart, and we could find you some space, mmm
[00:12.36]我心如天堂 能为你找到空间
[00:19.40]I could be the world to you, the missing piece
[00:19.40]我愿成为你的世界 那缺失的拼图
[00:22.60]That extra sentimental kind of chemistry
[00:22.60]那种额外浪漫的化学反应
[00:25.99]Some people make it hard, with me, that isn't the case
[00:25.99]有些人让爱情艰难 与我却截然不同
[00:30.54]'Cause I make it so easy to fall in love
[00:30.54]因为我让坠入爱河如此轻松
[00:37.28]So come give me a call, and we'll fall into us
[00:37.28]快给我来电 我们将坠入彼此
[00:44.07]I'm the perfect mix of Saturday night and the rest of your life
[00:44.07]我是周六夜晚与你余生的完美融合
[00:49.52]Anyone with a heart would agree
[00:49.52]任何有心之人都会认同
